STS1-style touchscreen controls for Slay the Spire 2.

[b]Combat[/b]
Drag cards to play, or tap a card to inspect it before choosing a target. Targeted cards stay at the lower center while aiming; untargeted cards follow your finger. Ally targets also work through the party sidebar.

[b]Choose with confidence[/b]
Inspect card rewards and shop items before confirming with native game buttons. Scroll supported lists without accidentally selecting entries, and hold supported cards to inspect them. Existing relic, intent, power, and teammate tooltips remain available.

[b]Enable touchscreen mode[/b]
Subscribe, restart the game, and enable Touchscreen mode in the input settings. Hold to inspect and Touch feedback can be toggled separately. Settings follow the current game language. BaseLib and ModConfig provide optional alternative settings entry points; neither is required.

Mouse input follows the same rules while touchscreen mode is enabled. Controller input temporarily takes over. Enabling mods uses the game's separate modded save tree.

Targets STS2 v0.111.0. The cover artwork illustrates touch input.
